1
00:00:02,804 --> 00:00:06,378
The check-in table. Many check-ins at once

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:12,483
The check-in table shows every goal and metric as rows, and their history as columns.

3
00:00:12,602 --> 00:00:16,954
Snap to sets one column per hour, day, week or month.

4
00:00:17,074 --> 00:00:22,146
Type a value for each metric in the right-hand column. Enter moves to the next one.

5
00:00:22,286 --> 00:00:26,208
Then click Save, once, for all of them.

6
00:00:26,323 --> 00:00:30,884
Hover a value to read its note. Drag a row's name to reorder.
